ok - an origin on SSH port 29418 proposes forge=gerrit and names the evidence
ok - a refs/for/ push refspec proposes forge=gerrit and names the evidence
ok - a remote carrying neither Gerrit fact proposes forge=none
ok - an origin host that is or has the label gitlab proposes forge=gitlab
ok - an origin host configured in glab proposes forge=gitlab, below Gerrit's protocol facts
ok - detection reads the clone's config and changes nothing
not ok - a plain directory did not exit 2 (got 0)
